{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "0835ad10df43ecb48cfdc63f53967f0224a5bb3689ac665451d30536cccd7f21", "ja": "バトル前から波乱の予感！？", "zh": "战斗开始前就有波澜起伏的预感！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ba4251930303f60b3419e634690313d6eb0bc61aa739f8e1ff9fd901ca0db884", "ja": "撮影に先立って、まずは番宣用の映像を撮る\n事に。風花＆紬VS茜＆響、それぞれペアに\n振り分けられ、闘争本能をぶつけ合う。その\n後、共演者たちに挨拶回りし、ご当地ノリに\n多少戸惑ったりしつつも好スタートを切る。", "zh": "在正式拍摄前，决定先拍摄用于宣传节目的影像。风花＆紬VS茜＆响，分别组成两组搭档，碰撞彼此的斗争本能。之后向共演者们逐一打招呼，虽然对当地的氛围多少有些困惑，但还是取得了一个不错的开端。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "27c7b693774e7575bc2891313eb08c80647b768fad6024d42e06c9534ce860c6", "ja": "（番組の撮影は、ツアー公演の合間に行われる。今日は\n番宣用の動画を撮るそうで、先方の局にやってきた）", "zh": "（节目拍摄安排在巡演公演的间隙进行。听说今天要拍摄宣传视频，所以我们来到了对方电视台）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1001_camman", "source_sha256": "995d86128c41527731d701e04ec8d429bffb47cd382f72e9f3a48dda6b9940b6", "ja": "皆さん、もっとググッと近づいてもらって……\n相手の鼻に噛み付くつもりで、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "大家再靠近一点……\n请摆出要咬住对方鼻子的架势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "39a8f93b2efae9aa4528c063f5a5111555428a4f10984d019583155c0188ff26", "ja": "は、鼻に、噛み付く……！？\n私が、我那覇さんの鼻に？　それはちょっと……。", "zh": "咬、咬鼻子……！？\n我去咬我那霸小姐的鼻子？这有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "06890050baa157480becefdcb573260c4f232780466dfeb08ef91665ae5e2458", "ja": "つむりん？　一応言っとくけど、比喩だからネ？\n格闘技のポスターとかでよくあるヤツだよ！", "zh": "紬琳？先说一下，这是比喻哦？\n就是格斗技海报上经常出现的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "bdb8d55ca9c48cf6b73e14852d6092291a6cc962c6465d3c93164a61efaac3e7", "ja": "がうがうっ！　遠慮しなくていいぞ～、紬。\n本当に噛み付くくらいの勢いがなきゃ、ダメだからね！", "zh": "嗷呜嗷呜！不用客气哦～，紬。得有那种真要咬上去的气势才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7336c719e7db9815ee53d10d74eb885639c9fd5f48d0f6efda5b77eed6ade3bc", "ja": "こ、こうかしら……？　わんっ、わんわんっ！\nすみません私、あまり迫力がなくて……。", "zh": "这、这样吗……？汪、汪汪！  \n抱歉，我好像没什么气势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1006_camman", "source_sha256": "79b0866fdaf53198a94ff8ad7b00664437ad247714d7c7333a8fb7c2c5798686", "ja": "いえいえ、いい感じですよ！\nじゃあ次は、相手のチームを罵ってみてください！", "zh": "不会不会，感觉很棒哦！\n那接下来，请试着痛骂对方队伍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1b12042e8a029242b1e1ea247ac2b8c75daa2da8eaf262ebefad1c65aebb5449", "ja": "の、罵るって、そんな急な……！\nええと、その……だ、だ……だらぶちっ！", "zh": "骂、骂人什么的，也太突然了吧……！\n呃，那个……笨、笨……笨蛋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1440e0eb0da81b4ffb4390bd4a94c8146275eb6845ce69d2f99720d0b6d28dd6", "ja": "うぅ……お、おばかさーんっ！", "zh": "呜呜……大、大笨蛋——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2c75ee3dd91d450ef255b768d853ee7d8f37f0d18063bf1c0aa32dc114bd0b89", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nバッチリだったな！　面白い映像になったと思うよ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n表现得非常棒！拍出了很有意思的画面哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "a20e787e182fd8084bc8f80a08b248a6ff843d689d6ab7d0fd4488be27e36de5", "ja": "あちゃ～、面白くなっちゃってたか！　カッコよく\nキメたつもりだったんだけどな～……まあ、ヨシ。", "zh": "哎呀～结果变得很搞笑了吗！我本来是想帅气地耍一把的啊～……不过嘛，也挺好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aca2ef33e8ef7be8fa797c8d997e3d1622e41b019ba68d3eb093e0d9dc8480c0", "ja": "あの……我那覇さん、野々原さん。申し訳ありません。\n指示があったとはいえ、酷いことを言ってしまって。", "zh": "那个……我那霸、野野原。真的很抱歉。  \n虽然是因为接到了指示，但我还是说了很过分的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f7c681817986cbb976b752fb009c336a49190317e46a1f9a3d9a391dc82f0275", "ja": "私も、ごめんなさい……。\n対戦チームだからって、言いすぎちゃったかな。", "zh": "我也很抱歉……。\n因为是对战队伍，我是不是说得太过分了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "e3bb10b6a8e1bfd876a72a1ecd982bccdb3c5ae5688e7cfef68320d71c6442d1", "ja": "全然気にしてないぞ、っていうか紬のは、\nどういう意味だかあんまりわかんなかったし……。", "zh": "我完全没放在心上啦，话说回来，紬说的那些，我也不太明白是什么意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "234e5e8b17b79c6dd5f31be595d138b8e0a67dffdeaf077b04b0fda16eadadec", "ja": "自分は、こういうバチバチした空気、\n嫌いじゃないからね！　もっとぶつかってきていいぞ♪", "zh": "我不讨厌这种剑拔弩张的气氛哦！尽管再放马过来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "833939b569ef6756b5e0b6423cdaac611905b721dd42e2647681753b3d88c9f3", "ja": "響ちゃん達、ノリノリだったもんね。\nおかげで私と紬ちゃんも、かなりやりやすかったかも。", "zh": "响她们当时都很来劲呢。多亏了她们，我和纺也觉得好发挥多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3b3bc76a46d0fe7250959049b66aaeab455fba7a645c91f18d061b6f11b7e48a", "ja": "ええ。今日の撮影は、どうにか乗り切りましたね。\nそれで、この後のスケジュールは……？", "zh": "嗯。今天的拍摄总算是撑过去了。那么，接下来的日程是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "b7ed040aac5b00206eca15615e7f99ba301c14bb78edde5b23b4ff73fdcf1d75", "ja": "決まってるじゃん、つむりん！　共演者のみなさんに、\n挨拶回りするんだよ。挨拶は業界の基本だからね。", "zh": "这不是已经定好了吗，紬琳！要去向一起演出的各位打招呼。打招呼可是这个行业的基本哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b40a4c1c062996b4dcdb18292e0d7cb051da62445b1f247d4506800399dd657", "ja": "あ、そっか……スタッフさん達には朝のうちに\nご挨拶できたけど、共演者さんはまだだったっけ。", "zh": "啊，对哦……早上已经跟工作人员们打过招呼了，但还没跟共演者们打招呼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0bd295b965c801d06b4c78a1579df66356c26356e069d6d9d7fe996f0e8a10d5", "ja": "そうだな。そろそろみなさん\n揃った頃だと思うし、行っておこうか。", "zh": "是啊。大家应该也差不多到齐了，我们过去打个招呼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3dd690cf50297dbdd4fd6594802c3038f4267e9cb58d3b86d34c16410368a6dd", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　今回共演させていただく、\n765プロダクションです。よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！我们是这次将与各位共同演出的765事务所，请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1026_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "fef6354ee80f22988a7177f5492d2162c9d6d3159c6416d3c6a401887d16cc0c", "ja": "どもども！　いや～、皆さんメッチャ可愛いですね。\nホンマのアイドルみたいやわ。", "zh": "多谢多谢！哎呀～大家真是超级可爱啊。简直就像真正的偶像一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "8cee7b3818d1c5a12e35802d4b506e195090f2c34a789e1598a03340bb8cabc8", "ja": "あー、それね、よく言われるんですよね～♪\n……って、ちっがーう！　本物！　アイドルだから！", "zh": "啊～那个啊，经常有人这么说呢～♪\n……不对啦！货真价实的！茜就是偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1028_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "780c12e45f959eaeeb07ee63a9e7c144af8576bf03afa8747a5475687d8e41a7", "ja": "おおっ！？　キレのあるノリツッコミしますやん……\nこれピンときたわ！　コンビ組みません？", "zh": "哦哦！？这接梗吐槽也太利落了吧……\n我突然有感觉了！要不要组个搭档？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "be8a5dd598e852ddb2e3fe27e6b546d5c8d78e437a2e470d8f21fc66c1cc3785", "ja": "ダメダメ！　そういうのはキチンと\n事務所を通してよね！　茜は渡さないぞーっ！", "zh": "不行不行！这种事要好好通过事务所来谈！茜可不会交给你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1030_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "1ae6d1d0ed5412207b37578f5fd7f95c5683081efdd53001ae91245d6dafe2ac", "ja": "ははは！　ゲストさん困らせたらアカンよ。\nあ、どうも、番組の司会者です。よろしゅう。", "zh": "哈哈哈！可不能让嘉宾为难呀。\n啊，你好，我是节目的主持人。请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a9cf80bdacff8465f1e962e18b73bcd997c98ccf46acddbd14ca79eb13e0ed41", "ja": "お疲れさまです。765プロの白石紬です。\n皆さんとご一緒できて、大変光栄に思います。", "zh": "辛苦了。我是765制作人的白石紬。\n能和大家一起工作，我感到非常荣幸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dc51d1890283e913d8cdffb1d62d76f7cde35c42f50173e29b1f586b0e659278", "ja": "たくさん勉強させていただくつもりで、\n頑張ります。どうぞよろしくお願い致します。", "zh": "我会好好向大家学习，努力加油。还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1033_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "6aa762e36110739154dd615b39cd65af80168a6b8280a67d9c3f278b4b8f1be1", "ja": "っと、これはこれは、ご丁寧に……。\nちょっと師匠！　師匠からも一言、お願いしますよ。", "zh": "哎呀，这可真是……您太客气了。\n等等，师父！也请您说两句吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1034_oogosho", "source_sha256": "1a2cc4f1dd278cdad4dffbec1031cfc377ad7662a269472ad41c047bab0189e8", "ja": "よっしゃ、任せとき！　ガツンと言ったるわ。\nあー、ゴホン！　あんな、自分ら……サインください！", "zh": "好嘞，交给我吧！我会狠狠说他们一顿的。\n啊——咳咳！那个，你们……请给我签名吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1035_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "99198a3db3bb2416618d0b7f92d3316a624605981acd7d937a2bcc0226dfd6a8", "ja": "ガツンと何言うてはるんですか！\nそんなんオレかて欲しい！　こっちもくださーい！", "zh": "您这是在说什么呀！\n那种东西我也想要！这边也给我一份——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b5b360d4fbb6a6b9ef7ceba645989d8f39ff97d75482bdd7abd691111c57fd2", "ja": "あはは、なんて言うか、勢いが凄いなぁ……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，怎么说呢，这气势真厉害啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "ee11fc1b7e7144ea4b95ffdd0c79533ea69d07436149b1c2ebc80fb2803207f1", "ja": "ふたりとも、目がすっごく真剣だぞ……。", "zh": "你们两个的眼神都认真得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "18599f26d6d583a7970a2a224d044330c12aeca40e6901c54ea3dcc0617a473b", "ja": "ふぅ……一通り挨拶も終わったし、\n今日はこんなものかな。みんな、お疲れさま。", "zh": "呼……该打的招呼也都打完了，今天就先这样吧。大家辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1039_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d315a4334e283c89e7819f94639e0067dae46a7c67116b269cd4e5baca4f3d1f", "ja": "はい。皆さん、とてもノリがいいと言うか……。\n失礼がなかったかどうか、気がかりです。", "zh": "是的。大家都很热情，或者说很会配合……我有点担心自己有没有哪里失礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d7410b6e0d4d4494ee865bbc99c4243745aa80bc8739292ab46ecfe20cb8b5d6", "ja": "そうだよね。私もちゃんと対応できてたかどうか……。", "zh": "是啊，我也不知道自己有没有应对得当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1041_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "ca40f5dde1669148aa170184bcef7d257feaae882043730b3e63d3410fb138f6", "ja": "どうも、765プロさん。挨拶回り、\nありがとうございました。みんな喜んでましたよ。", "zh": "谢谢您，765制作人先生。感谢您去一一问候大家。\n大家都很开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "e3be3898b35be3e9653e7c1f0f2c21d67fa3220aa3218e5b90be83621cf9a9b1", "ja": "あ、ディレクターさん！　お世話になります。", "zh": "啊，导演先生！今后还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1043_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6cdef1600e71f20622c2abec07d5be91950541bf8f4afefab1d43ceeb5e87e3f", "ja": "お疲れさまです。本当ですか？\nそれならよかったです……ほっとしました♪", "zh": "辛苦了。真的吗？\n那就太好了……我也放心了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "a242e3620377e43423497fb421ebcf2ad51bc923628dd4896e397f9a40952105", "ja": "ホント、一安心だね！\nサインをたくさん書いた甲斐があったよ、ニャハッ☆", "zh": "真的，这下可以放心了呢！  \n写了这么多签名也算值得啦，喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1045_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "fb81c0c9db6f2f62672ac025e5b2b3925b9ae048094a48975513145ddcf03ca2", "ja": "すんません、ご厚意に甘えてしまって。\n久しぶりのゲストで、みんなはしゃぎよるんですわ。", "zh": "不好意思，承蒙你的好意，我就接受了。难得有久违的嘉宾，大家都兴奋起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1046_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "f4d6911fe0dbf1334eed9a62123f622eaa3924db6ac823d3d4cb06c029430c1e", "ja": "この番組は息が長い分、マンネリ化してまして……。\n皆さんが、新しい風になったってください！", "zh": "这个节目因为办了很久，已经有些套路化了……  \n请大家成为一股新风吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1047_013hib", "source_sha256": "2fd6684a28e039cc4e95b8b341d433e39a448b9c4d09ef038495f685a352974a", "ja": "なるほど。そういうことなら、自分達に任せるさー！\n新しい事に挑戦するのは得意だからね。", "zh": "原来如此。既然这样，就交给我们吧——！\n我们最擅长挑战新事物了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1048_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3423ede7f8e7eefea5f826eea285a3f265af7df81d55e698763a5056463a3fbe", "ja": "確かに。この企画自体、私達にとって新しい挑戦\nですしね……頑張って、盛り上げてみせます。", "zh": "确实。这个企划本身对我们来说也是一次新的挑战……我们会努力，让它热闹起来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0249_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "c083f8db7145b2d4a213928f789eca3d36c1d9b5dc0917efc447365d00fa3efb", "ja": "（うちにとっても、この番組にとっても、お互い\n刺激になったらいいな……期待してるぞ、みんな！）", "zh": "（对我们来说，对这个节目来说，要是能彼此带来刺激就好了……大家，我很期待你们的表现哦！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
